            0.883,
            0.349
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Observe the features of all the stages of a frog shown in Fig. 10.7. How will you decide the sequence of the given stages (A, B, C, D, E, F)? Some of the stages show distinct changes in their initial and final shapes. Record these changes in Table 10.5."
